# Oracle: VD cir-hier "Scope" (a subcircuit's instance reads its own parameters, then the
# top's) with read.rs's binding; VD dev-builtin-src (pulse defaults). An expression in a wave
# field is kept as written.
# codes:
file "scope.sim" deck
  title "sources in a subcircuit"
  param a = 2i
  model vsource source_v
  subckt s (p n) b=3i
    element vsource v1 (p n) model=vsource wave=pulse(v1=0 v2=(a * b) delay=0 rise=(a * 1n) fall=0 width=0 period=0 law=vacask) dc_rule=wave_at_zero
